31"}]},{"id":"atm_deposit_images","by":"harness","do":"Unlock get_atm_deposit_images_8473, then call it to get the envelope or check images. Compare them with the expected deposit amount. Tell the customer deposit disputes may take up to 45 days.","call":"call_discoverable_agent_tool","args":{"agent_tool_name":"get_atm_deposit_images_8473","transaction_id":"the disputed ATM deposit's transaction_id from get_transactions"},"lookup":[],"after":["choose_category"],"if":"dispute_category is atm_deposit_not_credited AND the ATM was a Rho-Bank ATM","quote":"Use get_atm_deposit_images_8473 to retrieve envelope/check images","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_033"},{"id":"deposit_compare","by":"model","do":"Compare the deposit images and the credited amount in get_transactions with the amount the customer says they deposited, and tell the customer what the records show.
