reversal","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_032"},{"clause":"affidavit","quote":"They have 10 business days to sign and return it","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_033"}]},{"id":"transfer_if_needed","by":"model","do":"If a filing or card action still fails after one corrected retry, explain what failed and ask whether the customer wants a human agent. Call transfer_to_human_agents only if they agree.","call":"transfer_to_human_agents","args":{"summary":"the disputes filed, any not filed, and the error","reason":"technical_system_error"},"lookup":["file_dispute"],"after":["file_dispute"],"if":"a required call returned an error that blocks the job AND the customer agrees to a transfer","quote":"If they do, invoke the appropriate transfer_to_human_agents tool.","doc":"policy","basis":[{"clause":"ask, then transfer if they agree","quote":"If they do, invoke the appropriate transfer_to_human_agents tool.","doc":"policy"},{"clause":"technical_system_error reason","quote":"System error or outage preventing completion of the customer's request","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_042"}]}],"rules":[{"rule":"The transaction must be at least $1.00","quote":"Transaction must be at least $1.00","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"The transaction date must be no more than 60 days before today (get_current_time)","quote":"Transaction must be within 60 days old","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"The linked checking account must be OPEN","quote":"The debit card must be linked to an OPEN checking account","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"Open debit disputes per account (existing plus new) must not exceed the tier maximum: Entry 2, Mid 3, Premium 4, Elite 5","quote":"Customer cannot exceed the maximum open disputes for their checking account tier: Entry Tier max 2, Mid Tier max 3, Premium Tier max 4, Elite Tier max 5. Dispute limits are per account, not per customer.","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"A dispute counts as open while its status is OPEN, PENDING_DOCUMENTATION, UNDER_REVIEW or PROVISIONAL_CREDIT_ISSUED","quote":"OPEN: Dispute filed, investigation in progress","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_035"},{"rule":"Light Blue is Entry tier (as are Light Green and Green Fee-Free)","quote":"ENTRY TIER (Light Blue Account, Light Green Account, Green Fee-Free Account)","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_005"},{"rule":"Blue Account and Green Account (checking) are Mid tier","quote":"MID TIER (Blue Account, Green Account (checking))","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_005"},{"rule":"Evergreen is Premium tier","quote":"PREMIUM TIER (Evergreen Account)","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_005"},{"rule":"Bluest is Elite tier","quote":"ELITE TIER (Bluest Account)","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_005"},{"rule":"When an unauthorized transaction is suspected fraud, use card_present_fraud for in-store or physical transactions and card_not_present_fraud for online or phone transactions. Use unauthorized_transaction only when fraud is not suspected.","quote":"When a transaction is unauthorized, determine if fraud is suspected. If YES, use 'card_present_fraud' (for in-store/physical transactions) or 'card_not_present_fraud' (for online/phone transactions).","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"A fraudulent P2P transfer the customer did not make, with no physical card use, is card_not_present_fraud","quote":"'card_not_present_fraud': Online/phone transaction customer didn't make - USE THIS when fraud suspected for online/phone transactions","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"A family member using the card without permission is unauthorized_transaction (fraud not suspected)","quote":"Only use 'unauthorized_transaction' when fraud is NOT suspected (e.g., family member used card without permission, customer forgot about a transaction, etc.).","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"EveryonePay and other P2P transfers use transaction_type person_to_person","quote":"'person_to_person': P2P transfer (EveryonePay, etc.)","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"A charge higher than expected is incorrect_amount, with card_action keep_active","quote":"'incorrect_amount': Charged different amount than expected","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"Goods or services paid for and not received are goods_services_not_received, with card_action keep_active","quote":"'goods_services_not_received': Paid but never received item/service","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"If the customer is unsure whether the PIN was compromised, pin_compromised is unknown","quote":"'unknown': Customer unsure","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"If the customer believes the PIN was observed or skimmed, pin_compromised is yes_observed","quote":"'yes_observed': Customer believes PIN was observed/skimmed","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"An in-store purchase with a PIN is pin_purchase","quote":"'pin_purchase': In-store purchase with PIN","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"An ATM cash withdrawal is atm_withdrawal","quote":"'atm_withdrawal': ATM cash withdrawal","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"Card action by category: the fraud categories map to close_and_reissue, unauthorized_transaction maps to freeze_pending_investigation, and all other categories map to keep_active","quote":"'card_present_fraud' → 'close_and_reissue'","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"The card_action argument only records metadata. After filing, the agent performs the most severe action once per card.","quote":"This parameter records metadata only; the agent must separately perform the indicated card action after filing the dispute.","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"Only filed disputes decide a card's action. A dispute held back by the limit sets no card action.","quote":"However, when performing the actual card action after filing all disputes, use the MOST SEVERE action across all disputes.","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"Provisional credit is required when ALL of these hold:
- reported within 60 days of the statement date showing the transaction;
- the category is unauthorized_transaction, card_present_fraud, card_not_present_fraud, atm_cash_discrepancy or duplicate_charge;
- a written statement was provided;
- the account is OPEN with no holds or restrictions.","quote":"**Provisional Credit is REQUIRED when ALL of these conditions are met:**","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_032"},{"rule":"Provisional credit is not required (may be offered at discretion) in these cases, and provisional_credit_eligible is then false:
