- the account is under 30 days old and the transaction is card-not-present.","quote":"**Provisional Credit is NOT REQUIRED (but may be offered at discretion) when:**","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_032","basis":[{"clause":"merchant contact case","quote":"Customer has not contacted merchant first (for non-fraud disputes)","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_032"},{"clause":"PIN shared case","quote":"Customer shared their PIN voluntarily (pin_compromised = 'yes_shared')","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_032"},{"clause":"new account card-not-present case","quote":"Account is less than 30 days old AND the dispute is for a card-not-present transaction","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_032"}]},{"rule":"Provisional credit is the full amount, reduced by the liability ($50 or $500) if reported late","quote":"Liability offset: If customer reported late, reduce by their liability amount ($50 or $500)","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_032"},{"rule":"A report more than 2 business days after the statement showing the transaction, but within 60 days of it, has a maximum liability of $500","quote":"- Reported within 60 days of statement: Maximum liability $500","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"customer_max_liability_amount follows the doc 031 tier counted from the statement, capped at the disputed amount: $50, $500, or -1 (unlimited) after 60 days","quote":"Reported after 60 days: Unlimited liability - customer may not recover funds","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_031"},{"rule":"Third-party ATM disputes go to the ATM owner or network as a chargeback, and the investigation can take up to 90 days. Where provisional credit applies, it is still due within 10 business days.","quote":"Provisional credit is still required within 10 business days","doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_033"},{"rule":"A Rho-Bank ATM deposit dispute is checked against the 