ing"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_032","why":"Provisional credit guidelines"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_033","why":"ATM dispute branches"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_034","why":"Recurring charge category and order of dispute vs. block"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_035","why":"Dispute status lookup and open statuses"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_036","why":"Police report recommendation, typical timelines"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_037","why":"Regulation E liability timing (named by the dispute tool)"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_005","why":"Checking product to tier mapping"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_009","why":"Account lookup"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_018","why":"Transaction lookup and status field"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_028","why":"Card lookup"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_025","why":"Closing a debit card"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_026","why":"Freezing/unfreezing a debit card"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_029","why":"Replacement tier rules and fees"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_023","why":"Debit card order eligibility"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_030","why":"Lost/stolen cross-product handoff"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_041","why":"PIN lock investigation handoff"},{"id":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_042","why":"Transfer reason codes"},{"id":"doc_checking_accounts_checking_accounts_(general)_003","why":"Fraud alert not cleared when a transaction is denied"}],"set_aside":[{"doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_024","why":"Activating a debit card; not part of filing disputes or ordering the replacement"},{"doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_043","why":"Savings account credits; not relevant to debit disputes"},{"doc":"doc_bank_accounts_bank_accounts_(general)_044","why":"Interest discrepancy reports; not relevant"},{"doc":"doc_checking_accounts_checking_accounts_(general)_006","why":"Balance and decline codes; not relevant to filing disputes"}],"open_questions":["No document says which dispute statuses count as 'open' toward the per-account limit. This workflow counts every status that is not resolved or closed.","No tool returns statement dates, yet the liability tiers and provisional-credit timeliness are counted from the statement. The workflow derives bounds from the transaction date and otherwise explains all tiers.","customer_max_liability_amount: the doc tiers are $50, $500 and unlimited, while the tool description also says 'and the disputed amount'. The workflow caps the tier at the disputed amount.","No document says what police_report_filed should be for non-fraud disputes, where the question is not asked. The agent records the customer's answer.","Provisional credit 'may be offered at discretion' in the NOT REQUIRED cases, but no document gives criteria for that discretion.","Doc 025 requires no pending transactions before a card is closed, yet also says pending transactions will still be processed after a fraud closure. The workflow applies the requirement."]}
